meta {
  name: 02_RequestActivityLog
  seq: 2
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Scenario: A request's draft and withdrawal are recorded in the request activity log

    Given the service owner creates a draft package request for the requester
    When the requester reads the log of requests it has made
    Then the draft is recorded as created, by the service owner
    And the draft is not in the requester's log of requests received
    And the requests read scope is enough to read the log
    But the connections scopes are not
    And an outsider cannot read the requester's log
    When the service owner withdraws the draft
    Then the withdrawal is recorded with the previous status
    And the activity type filter values list the draft and the withdrawal
}
